  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "What was the deploy window for the scheduler before it changed?\n[2025-11-03] standup/dune/2025-11-03-2: For newcomers: the deploy window for the job scheduler is still on weekdays between 08:00 and 10:00 UTC, never on Fridays. [2025-08-08] standup/dune/2025-08-08: New deploy window for the job scheduler: on weekdays between 08:00 and 10:00 UTC, never on Fridays. Forget the previous Tuesdays 13:00-15:00 UTC slot. Observation from the Dune team: after the marketing send, billing-api's queue depth hit 50,000. [2025-05-28] standup/dune/2025-05-28: Reminder: the scheduler deploys only on Tuesdays between 13:00 and 15:00 UTC.",
